    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918930/extras/5c27f061bda2cbf2955f26960c90ba24.poster.avif?t=1712398781\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918930/extras/5c27f061bda2cbf2955f26960c90ba24.webm?t=1712398781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918930/extras/5c27f061bda2cbf2955f26960c90ba24.mp4?t=1712398781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Typing Minigame Extravaganza!</h2><br>Chase high scores in a series of lightning-fast typing games! Use your keyboard to cast spells, write cool usernames, order food, explode space-cats and more! This ain't your grandpa's typing game, with over 50 unique minigames you're bound to leave the home row.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918930/extras/afff7113cb4bb4a7d806d99682cd6bba.poster.avif?t=1712398781\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918930/extras/afff7113cb4bb4a7d806d99682cd6bba.webm?t=1712398781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918930/extras/afff7113cb4bb4a7d806d99682cd6bba.mp4?t=1712398781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features!</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>50+ unique typing games - complete with unique art and music!<br></li><li>Multiple difficulties for both typing freaks and single-finger-sams!<br></li><li>Secret game modes!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918930/extras/5c27f061bda2cbf2955f26960c90ba24.poster.avif?t=1712398781\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918930/extras/5c27f061bda2cbf2955f26960c90ba24.webm?t=1712398781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918930/extras/5c27f061bda2cbf2955f26960c90ba24.mp4?t=1712398781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Typing Minigame Extravaganza!</h2><br>Chase high scores in a series of lightning-fast typing games! Use your keyboard to cast spells, write cool usernames, order food, explode space-cats and more! This ain't your grandpa's typing game, with over 50 unique minigames you're bound to leave the home row.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918930/extras/afff7113cb4bb4a7d806d99682cd6bba.poster.avif?t=1712398781\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918930/extras/afff7113cb4bb4a7d806d99682cd6bba.webm?t=1712398781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918930/extras/afff7113cb4bb4a7d806d99682cd6bba.mp4?t=1712398781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features!</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>50+ unique typing games - complete with unique art and music!<br></li><li>Multiple difficulties for both typing freaks and single-finger-sams!<br></li><li>Secret game modes!</li></ul>",
